# Placeholder directory for bundled YOLOv11x weights (.pt).
#
# Pre-trained weights (best.pt, ~457 MB) are downloaded automatically from
# Hugging Face (Ananthakrishnanmzen/PlantDiseaseDetection) on first load. To
# bundle weights locally instead, copy best.pt into this directory.
#
# Weights are NOT committed to this repository (large binary). See README.md.
